## AgySafe

This machine has the `agysafe` command installed.

When the user explicitly delegates a task to AgySafe / AGY / Antigravity:

```text
agysafe --workspace "." --json "<exact user task>"
```

Optional:

```text
--model <slug>
--mode <auto|ask|review|edit>
```

Defaults are automatic.
<!-- AGYSAFE:END -->
